<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's IRSA Q2 net $12.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's IRSA Q2 net $12.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to December 31. Net $12.6 million vs n/a. NOTE: IRSA Inversiones y Representaciones SA provided neither EPS nor comparative figures.</p>
<p>At December 31 its net worth stood at $272 million, it added.</p>
<p>((--Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
